config ODRIVE_SEQUENCER
	bool "ODrive axis bring-up and recovery ported from fibril_odrive_adapter"
	depends on CPP && STD_CPP17
	help
	  Calibrates an ODrive axis, arms it when a command arrives, switches
	  control modes through idle and clears errors until the axis can be
	  armed again. The caller reads the ODrive driver's snapshot once per
	  tick and carries out what the sequencer asks of the axis.
